 ## Goal
 
-Maximize **`AICompany.GetCompanyValue(AICompany.COMPANY_SELF)`** (= vehicle value at 1.5× purchase + infrastructure value + cash − loans). Use `AILog.Info(...)` / `AILog.Warning(...)` for debugging.
+Maximize your **company value**. OpenTTD 13.4 has no `AICompany.GetCompanyValue`: calling it stops your script ("the index 'GetCompanyValue' does not exist"). Read the value with **`AICompany.GetQuarterlyCompanyValue(AICompany.COMPANY_SELF, AICompany.CURRENT_QUARTER)`** (the running value), or with quarter `1` (the value recorded at the start of the current quarter). Company value = 1.5 × the current value of your vehicles + a fixed amount per station facility + cash − loan, with a floor of 1; roads, rails and other infrastructure do not count.
+
+**How it is scored:** for each seed map the judge reads the company value recorded at the most recent quarter boundary before the 20-year game ends, which is the value `GetQuarterlyCompanyValue(AICompany.COMPANY_SELF, 1)` returns at the end of the game (recorded on 1 October of the final year). A value of 1 or less does not count; the judge then falls back to the latest earlier quarter with a value above 1, or 0. The score is the mean over the 5 seed maps. Use `AILog.Info(...)` / `AILog.Warning(...)` for debugging.
 
